{"schema_version":"1","type":"decision","ts":"2026-08-11","feature":"run-ci-on-jdk-21-and-25","session":"verify-jdk-matrix-coverage","commit":"24ad1770a428a8019cd3ac10140ab70d0813d453","title":"Use one independent JDK matrix job","where":".github/workflows/build.yml verify job","why":"A single parameterized job guarantees both JDKs execute the same checkout, Maven setup, cache, and full verification lifecycle; fail-fast disabled preserves both results.","alternative":"Two copied JDK-specific jobs — rejected because their setup and verification steps could drift.","design":"../design.md#compatibility-boundary","constitution":"§VI","trust":"unverified","imported_from":"docs/fluencyloop/features/run-ci-on-jdk-21-and-25/sessions/verify-jdk-matrix-coverage.md#decision-1"}
